    "faq": {
      "type": "custom-section",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_group": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
            "wrap_in_card": false,
            "card_link": "",
            "color_scheme": "",
            "show_card_border": false,
            "layout_type": "flex",
            "width_desktop": 100,
            "layout_direction_desktop": "column",
            "layout_grid_columns_desktop": 3,
            "layout_gap_desktop": 15,
            "layout_wrap_desktop": "nowrap",
            "layout_justify_desktop": "flex-start",
            "layout_align_items_desktop": "flex-start",
            "same_as_desktop": true,
            "width_mobile": 100,
            "layout_direction_mobile": "column",
            "layout_grid_columns_mobile": 1,
            "layout_gap_mobile": 10,
            "layout_wrap_mobile": "nowrap",
            "layout_justify_mobile": "flex-start",
            "layout_align_items_mobile": "flex-start",
            "use_global_container_padding": true,
            "padding_horizontal": 30,
            "padding_vertical": 10,
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0,
            "additional_class": ""
          },
          "blocks": {
            "faq_h2": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                "text": "<h2>Tes questions, nos réponses</h2>",
                "text_style": "h3",
                "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                "font_weight": 400,
                "alignment": "left",
                "alignment_mobile": "left",
                "show_read_more": false,
                "read_more_length": 50,
                "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                "truncate": false,
                "truncate_length": 2,
                "margin_top": 0,
                "margin_bottom": 10,
                "additional_class": ""
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "faq_acc": {
              "type": "accordions",
              "settings": {
                "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                "icon": "caret",
                "dividers": true,
                "additional_class": ""
              },
              "blocks": {
                "q1": {
                  "type": "_accordion",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "heading": "Le tufting, c'est difficile ?",
                    "heading_tag": "p",
                    "heading_style": "paragraph",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "icon_custom": "",
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "t": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                        "text": "<p>Non, mais ça s'apprend. Les trois gestes qui font réussir ou rater une première pièce — tendre la toile, enfiler le fil, tenir la machine — sont expliqués pas à pas dans nos vidéos. Tu n'es jamais laissée seule devant ta toile.</p>",
                        "text_style": "paragraph",
                        "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                        "font_weight": 400,
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "alignment_mobile": "left",
                        "show_read_more": false,
                        "read_more_length": 50,
                        "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                        "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                        "truncate": false,
                        "truncate_length": 2,
                        "margin_top": 0,
                        "margin_bottom": 0,
                        "additional_class": ""
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "t"
                  ]
                },
                "q7": {
                  "type": "_accordion",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "heading": "Combien de temps pour un premier tapis ?",
                    "heading_tag": "p",
                    "heading_style": "paragraph",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "icon_custom": "",
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "t": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                        "text": "<p>Compte une demi-journée à une journée de travail pour une première pièce simple — c'est le repère qui revient le plus dans la communauté. L'important, c'est d'y aller zone par zone, guidée par nos vidéos, sans chercher la perfection au premier essai.</p>",
                        "text_style": "paragraph",
                        "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                        "font_weight": 400,
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "alignment_mobile": "left",
                        "show_read_more": false,
                        "read_more_length": 50,
                        "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                        "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                        "truncate": false,
                        "truncate_length": 2,
                        "margin_top": 0,
                        "margin_bottom": 0,
                        "additional_class": ""
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "t"
                  ]
                },
                "q2": {
                  "type": "_accordion",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "heading": "Il me faut quoi en plus du kit ?",
                    "heading_tag": "p",
                    "heading_style": "paragraph",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "icon_custom": "",
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "t": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                        "text": "<p>Un cadre pour tendre ta toile — le guide <a href=\"/pages/apprendre#cadre\">« Fabrique ton cadre » de la Tuftéo Academy</a> t'explique comment le faire toi-même pour environ 20 € — et de la colle pour la finition du dos.</p>",
                        "text_style": "paragraph",
                        "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                        "font_weight": 400,
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "alignment_mobile": "left",
                        "show_read_more": false,
                        "read_more_length": 50,
                        "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                        "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                        "truncate": false,
                        "truncate_length": 2,
                        "margin_top": 0,
                        "margin_bottom": 0,
                        "additional_class": ""
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "t"
                  ]
                },
                "q9": {
                  "type": "_accordion",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "heading": "Et si je me trompe de matériel ?",
                    "heading_tag": "p",
                    "heading_style": "paragraph",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "icon_custom": "",
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "t": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                        "text": "<p>C'est la grande peur des débutantes — et la raison d'être de notre kit : gun, tondeuse, toile et fils sont choisis pour fonctionner ensemble. Un doute avant de commander ? Écris-nous, on te répond en français avant ton achat.</p>",
                        "text_style": "paragraph",
                        "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                        "font_weight": 400,
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "alignment_mobile": "left",
                        "show_read_more": false,
                        "read_more_length": 50,
                        "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                        "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                        "truncate": false,
                        "truncate_length": 2,
                        "margin_top": 0,
                        "margin_bottom": 0,
                        "additional_class": ""
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "t"
                  ]
                },
                "q3": {
                  "type": "_accordion",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "heading": "Cut et Loop, quelle différence ?",
                    "heading_tag": "p",
                    "heading_style": "paragraph",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "icon_custom": "",
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "t": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                        "text": "<p>Cut = poils coupés, rendu velours. Loop = poils bouclés, rendu texturé. Le gun 2-en-1 fait les deux, et notre tutoriel dédié te montre comment passer de l'un à l'autre.</p>",
                        "text_style": "paragraph",
                        "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                        "font_weight": 400,
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "alignment_mobile": "left",
                        "show_read_more": false,
                        "read_more_length": 50,
                        "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                        "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                        "truncate": false,
                        "truncate_length": 2,
                        "margin_top": 0,
                        "margin_bottom": 0,
                        "additional_class": ""
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "t"
                  ]
                },
                "q8": {
                  "type": "_accordion",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "heading": "C'est bruyant ?",
                    "heading_tag": "p",
                    "heading_style": "paragraph",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "icon_custom": "",
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "t": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                        "text": "<p>Un tufting gun s'entend, comme un petit outil électrique — prévois de tufter en journée si tes murs sont fins. On préfère te le dire avant, pas après.</p>",
                        "text_style": "paragraph",
                        "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                        "font_weight": 400,
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "alignment_mobile": "left",
                        "show_read_more": false,
                        "read_more_length": 50,
                        "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                        "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                        "truncate": false,
                        "truncate_length": 2,
                        "margin_top": 0,
                        "margin_bottom": 0,
                        "additional_class": ""
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "t"
                  ]
                },
                "q4": {
                  "type": "_accordion",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "heading": "La machine s'entretient ?",
                    "heading_tag": "p",
                    "heading_style": "paragraph",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "icon_custom": "",
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "t": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                        "text": "<p>Oui, et c'est simple : une goutte d'huile toutes les 2 heures d'utilisation. C'est dans ton guide et en vidéo — et ça change la durée de vie de ta machine.</p>",
                        "text_style": "paragraph",
                        "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                        "font_weight": 400,
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "alignment_mobile": "left",
                        "show_read_more": false,
                        "read_more_length": 50,
                        "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                        "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                        "truncate": false,
                        "truncate_length": 2,
                        "margin_top": 0,
                        "margin_bottom": 0,
                        "additional_class": ""
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "t"
                  ]
                },
                "q5": {
                  "type": "_accordion",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "heading": "Vos produits sont-ils vraiment complets ?",
                    "heading_tag": "p",
                    "heading_style": "paragraph",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "icon_custom": "",
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "t": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                        "text": "<p>Nous présentons chaque produit à partir de données concrètes et distinguons ce qui est contrôlé de ce qui reste à confirmer, sans spec inventée. Tu décides en connaissance de cause, et notre service client répond à tes questions avant l'achat.</p>",
                        "text_style": "paragraph",
                        "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                        "font_weight": 400,
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "alignment_mobile": "left",
                        "show_read_more": false,
                        "read_more_length": 50,
                        "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                        "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                        "truncate": false,
                        "truncate_length": 2,
                        "margin_top": 0,
                        "margin_bottom": 0,
                        "additional_class": ""
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "t"
                  ]
                },
                "q6": {
                  "type": "_accordion",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "heading": "Quels sont les délais de livraison et les retours ?",
                    "heading_tag": "p",
                    "heading_style": "paragraph",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "icon_custom": "",
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "t": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                        "text": "<p>La livraison est offerte en France, avec suivi. Tu disposes d'un droit de rétractation de 14 jours après réception. Notre service client, en français, t'accompagne avant comme après l'achat.</p>",
                        "text_style": "paragraph",
                        "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                        "font_weight": 400,
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "alignment_mobile": "left",
                        "show_read_more": false,
                        "read_more_length": 50,
                        "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                        "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                        "truncate": false,
                        "truncate_length": 2,
                        "margin_top": 0,
                        "margin_bottom": 0,
                        "additional_class": ""
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "t"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "q1",
                "q7",
                "q2",
                "q9",
                "q3",
                "q8",
                "q4",
                "q5",
                "q6"
              ]
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "faq_h2",
            "faq_acc"
          ]
        }
      },
